      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Centre Pokémon de Rosavilliers",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430065006E00740072006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200064006500200052006F0073006100760069006C006C00690065007200730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourriez-vous choisir une autre destination ?\nJ’ai peur de me perdre...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’accord ! En... en avant !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00442019006100630063006F007200640020002100200045006E002E002E002E00200065006E0020006100760061006E007400200021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ha ha ! Je suis sûre que vous ne vous attendiez\npas à ça... un taxi qui ne va qu’à un seul endroit !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est que... c’est le seul endroit où je suis sûre\nd’arriver sans me perdre...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je... J’adore la tarte à la fraise du Café Récré.\nEt vous, quel est votre dessert préféré ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah ! Ce n’est pas comme ça qu’on fait\nla conversation ! Attendez, je réessaie...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, vraiment, avec tous ces Pokémon sauvages,\nc’est difficile de conduire son taxi en ville !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous vous demandez sûrement pourquoi\nj’ai décidé de devenir chauffeuse, du coup !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100680020002100210021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je me suis trompée de rue...\nJe dois faire marche arrière... Excusez-moi...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... On parlait de pourquoi je suis devenue\nchauffeuse de taxi, n’est-ce pas ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "AH !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100480020002100210021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On est déjà arrivé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀes au Centre Pokémon\nde Rosavilliers !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nComme promis, vous ne me devez rien.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007200630069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aimerais régler ma course.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900610069006D006500720061006900730020007200E90067006C006500720020006D006100200063006F0075007200730065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est moi qui vous remercie d’avoir bien voulu\nme donner une chance !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004320190065007300740020006D006F0069002000710075006900200076006F00750073002000720065006D0065007200630069006500200064201900610076006F006900720020006200690065006E00200076006F0075006C0075000A006D006500200064006F006E006E0065007200200075006E00650020006300680061006E0063006500200021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais non, ce n’est pas nécessaire...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEnfin, si vous insistez.\nÇa fera 710 <U+E300>, s’il vous plaît !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais non, ce n’est pas nécessaire...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEnfin, si vous insistez.\nÇa fera 710 <U+E300>, s’il vous plaît !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOh, mais vous n’avez pas assez d’argent !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Après cette première expérience... j’ai compris\nque je n’avais pas du tout le niveau.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’arrivais même pas à faire la conversation ! Ce\nn’est pas comme ça qu’on fidélise sa clientèle !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Heureusement, il y a bien une chose\nque je maîtrise... les combats Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nÇa vous dirait d’en faire un ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Client<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe numéro un ! Faisons un combat !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006C00690065006E007400100003110000FF010000650020006E0075006D00E90072006F00200075006E0020002100200046006100690073006F006E007300200075006E00200063006F006D00620061007400200021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non, ça ira...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E002C002000E700610020006900720061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci de me donner l’occasion de me montrer\nsous un meilleur jour !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650072006300690020006400650020006D006500200064006F006E006E006500720020006C2019006F00630063006100730069006F006E0020006400650020006D00650020006D006F006E0074007200650072000A0073006F0075007300200075006E0020006D00650069006C006C0065007500720020006A006F0075007200200021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, s’il vous plaît ! Laissez-moi vous montrer\nmes talents !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C0020007320190069006C00200076006F0075007300200070006C006100EE0074002000210020004C00610069007300730065007A002D006D006F006900200076006F007500730020006D006F006E0074007200650072000A006D00650073002000740061006C0065006E0074007300200021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿)",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Même en combat Pokémon, je suis nulle...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00EA006D006500200065006E00200063006F006D00620061007400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002C0020006A0065002000730075006900730020006E0075006C006C0065002E002E002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais même si j’ai perdu, je me suis bien amusée !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020006D00EA006D00650020007300690020006A201900610069002000700065007200640075002C0020006A00650020006D0065002000730075006900730020006200690065006E00200061006D0075007300E9006500200021001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Normalement, plus on fait de combats Pokémon,\nplus on prend confiance en soi...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peut-être que c’est pareil avec le taxi !\nEnfin, si je continue...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500750074002D00EA0074007200650020007100750065002000632019006500730074002000700061007200650069006C002000610076006500630020006C00650020007400610078006900200021000A0045006E00660069006E002C0020007300690020006A006500200063006F006E00740069006E00750065002E002E002E001000020114014E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci pour votre aide aujourd’hui,\nclient<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe numéro un !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
